                "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
              }
            }
          },
          "docs": "Returns updated company user info. `globalPermissions` field is deprecated. Please use the following: \n* [addGlobalPermissionsForIdentity](#/Company/addGlobalPermissionsForIdentity) \n* [clearGlobalPermissions](#/Company/clearGlobalPermissions)"
        },
        {
